---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="About Us - Real Playback Speed" description="About Real Playback Speed, the free online playback speed calculator for YouTube, Netflix, Spotify, audiobooks, and video.">
  <section class="section-container" style="padding: var(--spacing-3xl) var(--spacing-lg); max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: var(--font-size-body-sm); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-link);">About Us</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-xl); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-xl); color: var(--color-ink); margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-lg);">About Real Playback Speed</h1>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Real Playback Speed is a free online playback speed calculator built to help you take control of your watching and listening time.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Our Mission</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      We believe media should fit your schedule, not the other way around. Whether you're speeding through a long YouTube tutorial, finishing an audiobook chapter, or planning a Netflix binge, our tool tells you exactly how long your content will take at any speed and how much time you'll save.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">What We Offer</h2>
    <ul style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md); padding-left: var(--spacing-lg);">
      <li>Standard playback speed calculator</li>
      <li>Target time / reverse calculator</li>
      <li>Playlist batch calculator</li>
      <li>YouTube URL duration auto-detection</li>
      <li>Keyboard shortcuts and presets</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      The site runs entirely in your browser with no account required. Try the <a href="/" style="color: var(--color-link);">calculator</a> to get started.
    </p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
